  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Font & Theme**\n\nI\'m currently focused on preparing edits for `layout.tsx` and `globals.css`. I\'ve decided on Lora and Montserrat as the preferred fonts for the project. In `globals.css`, I\'ve begun to define a theme using CSS variables, specifying colors like a teal brand color and a navy brand color, setting up the basic theme.\n\n\n**Refining Metadata Details**\n\nI\'ve just added detailed metadata within `layout.tsx`, including title, description, and OpenGraph/Twitter configurations for Rivo Lending. I focused on making these concise and informative for SEO and social sharing. I\'ve used Montserrat and Lora fonts for headings and body. The changes should be reflected across the website.\n\n\n**Implementing Navigation & Layout**\n\nI\'m now integrating the `Navbar` component and setting up the overall layout. The navbar is using `useState` for mobile menu toggling, and I\'ve integrated `motion` and `AnimatePresence` for animations. I\'ve also set up responsive design with a mobile menu icon and links for page navigation.\n\n\n**Constructing Navigation Component**\n\nI\'m currently building the `Navbar` component, focusing on responsive design. I\'ve integrated a logo with a unique design and the navigation links. I\'m prioritizing the desktop view initially, then will add mobile menu functionality. The branding will feature teal and navy colors.\n\n\n**Finalizing Navigation Details**\n\nI\'ve just added a \"Get an Assessment\" button to the `Navbar`, improving the overall calls to action. I am also finalizing the mobile menu functionality, including the X and Menu icons, transitioning the component using `motion` and `AnimatePresence`. The mobile menu now toggles and displays navigation links and closes on link click.\n\n\n**Adding Footer Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating the `Footer` component, starting with a basic structure for the different sections. I\'ve included `lucide-react` icons for contact info and links to enhance user interaction. I\'m focusing on responsiveness, so it adapts to different screen sizes and ensures readability. I\'ve set up a basic grid layout, which will include sections for the company logo/name and basic contact information.\n\n\n**Integrating Company Information**\n\nI\'ve just added company details into the footer, specifically the company name and a brief description. I\'ve included contact information using `lucide-react` icons and a phone number and email address, improving user engagement. I\'m prioritizing making this section informative and easy to read. I\'ve also added basic navigation links.\n\n\n**Adding Navigation Links**\n\nI\'ve just added navigation links to the footer, specifically for \"About Us\" and \"Contact\". I also included links under a \"Services\" heading, including \"First Home Buyer,\" \"Refinancing,\" \"Investment Loans,\" and \"Commercial Finance\" to enhance accessibility. My focus is ensuring these are easily accessible and visually consistent.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 37
      nanos: 584763012
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
