  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully transformed the application into a full, multi-page professional website for **Rivo Lending**, utilizing the visual identity provided in your logo and taking structural inspiration from your reference sites.\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n- **Brand Identity & Typography**: I extracted the precise Teal (`#00B4B6`) and Deep Navy (`#1A2E44`) from your logo and established them as the global brand theme. The typography has been updated to pair **Lora** (a refined serif for headings, matching the \"RIVO\" text) with **Montserrat** (a clean geometric sans-serif for body and labels, matching the \"LENDING\" text). \n- **Multi-Page Architecture**: I migrated the site from a single-page layout to a robust, multi-page Next.js structure. It now features a persistent `Navbar` and `Footer`, with dedicated routes:\n  - `/` (Home Page)\n  - `/about` (About Us)\n  - `/services` (Comprehensive Services)\n  - `/contact` (Lead Capture Form)\n- **Framer Motion Animations**: I introduced subtle, premium animations across the entire application using `motion/react`. Elements gracefully fade and slide up (`whileInView`) as the user scrolls, creating a polished, highly professional feel without being overwhelming.\n- **Reference-Inspired Structure**: I modeled the sections after the Laxmi Home Loans reference (incorporating the hero, 3-step value propositions, services grid, and testimonials), but completely redesigned their visual execution to align perfectly with Rivo Lending\'s new premium color palette. \n\nThe application is completely compiled, responsive, and ready for use!"
