  planner_response {
    response: "I have completely overhauled the application to align with your new **premium, trustworthy, modern Australian finance** design direction, completely moving away from the generic SaaS template. \n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n- **Premium Typographic & Color System**: Configured the global theme using your precise brand colors (Deep Navy and RIVO Teal) alongside a warm off-white canvas (`#F7F8F5`). I established a high-contrast editorial hierarchy by pairing **DM Serif Display** for striking, elegant headings with **Manrope** for highly legible, geometric body copy and UI elements.\n- **RIVO Brand Identity Integration**: Replaced the static header text with a custom typographic logo featuring the signature RIVO Teal/Navy SVG wave. This wave motif is purposefully echoed throughout the layout\342\200\224acting as seamless visual transitions between major sections (like the deep navy \"RIVO Difference\" block) to reinforce brand recognition.\n- **Bespoke, High-Conversion Hero**: Designed a split-composition hero section featuring real lifestyle photography, anchored by a purposeful floating metric card (*Loan secured: $780,000*) rather than generic chat bubbles.\n- **Interactive Mortgage Calculator**: Built a visually impressive, custom-styled borrowing calculator using the brand\'s teal accent, instantly allowing users to model property values and deposits to see estimated monthly repayments and LVR.\n- **Refined Layout Architecture**: Implemented the precise 14-section structural flow you mapped out\342\200\224from the horizontal \"Your Journey\" timeline and the human-centric Broker profile, down to the visual Lender Network map and the high-contrast gradient final CTA.\n- **Sophisticated Component Styling**: Removed all heavy borders and generic drop-shadows in favor of generous whitespace (`py-32`), 16\342\200\22324px soft radii, and extremely subtle ambient shadows (`0 8px 30px rgb(0,0,0,0.04)`), creating a quiet, established, and distinctly premium feel.\n\nThe application is fully compiled, responsive across all devices, and ready for you to preview!"
    thinking: "**Detailing Project Updates**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the application compiles without errors, and all necessary files are created. I\'m now transitioning my focus to summarizing the recent application modifications for the user. Based on their input, I\'ve incorporated Deep Navy (`#173552`) and Rivo Teal (`#08B2B0`) as the primary color scheme.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completely overhauled the application to align with your new **premium, trustworthy, modern Australian finance** design direction, completely moving away from the generic SaaS template. \n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n- **Premium Typographic & Color System**: Configured the global theme using your precise brand colors (Deep Navy and RIVO Teal) alongside a warm off-white canvas (`#F7F8F5`). I established a high-contrast editorial hierarchy by pairing **DM Serif Display** for striking, elegant headings with **Manrope** for highly legible, geometric body copy and UI elements.\n- **RIVO Brand Identity Integration**: Replaced the static header text with a custom typographic logo featuring the signature RIVO Teal/Navy SVG wave. This wave motif is purposefully echoed throughout the layout\342\200\224acting as seamless visual transitions between major sections (like the deep navy \"RIVO Difference\" block) to reinforce brand recognition.\n- **Bespoke, High-Conversion Hero**: Designed a split-composition hero section featuring real lifestyle photography, anchored by a purposeful floating metric card (*Loan secured: $780,000*) rather than generic chat bubbles.\n- **Interactive Mortgage Calculator**: Built a visually impressive, custom-styled borrowing calculator using the brand\'s teal accent, instantly allowing users to model property values and deposits to see estimated monthly repayments and LVR.\n- **Refined Layout Architecture**: Implemented the precise 14-section structural flow you mapped out\342\200\224from the horizontal \"Your Journey\" timeline and the human-centric Broker profile, down to the visual Lender Network map and the high-contrast gradient final CTA.\n- **Sophisticated Component Styling**: Removed all heavy borders and generic drop-shadows in favor of generous whitespace (`py-32`), 16\342\200\22324px soft radii, and extremely subtle ambient shadows (`0 8px 30px rgb(0,0,0,0.04)`), creating a quiet, established, and distinctly premium feel.\n\nThe application is fully compiled, responsive across all devices, and ready for you to preview!"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 384387582
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
