  planner_response {
    response: "I have completely rebuilt the layout architecture to establish a deliberate, premium visual hierarchy that honors your brand direction. The application is compiled and ready for preview.\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n- **Simplified Navigation Architecture**: The navigation is now reduced to the essential `Services \302\267 About \302\267 Resources` alongside a single, clear `Book a consultation` button. The anchor IDs (`#services`, `#about`, `#resources`) now properly map to the corresponding sections on the homepage.\n- **Masterful Visual Pacing**: I reorganized the homepage so that only four key sections (Hero, Services Entry, Brand Difference, and the Final Gradient CTA) feel like major editorial moments. The rest of the content (Lender Network, Calculator, Testimonials, FAQ) has been converted into visually quieter \"texture bands.\" This allows the site to breathe and prevents feature fatigue.\n- **Restrained Lender Strip**: The enormous abstract lender network was entirely removed. In its place, I introduced a quiet, grayscale credibility strip under the hero containing the 50+ lenders stat paired with subtle typography-based lender placeholders.\n- **Multilingual Brand Recognition**: The ability to serve clients in `English \302\267 \340\244\250\340\245\207\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\245\200 \302\267 \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200` is now a distinctive, recurring brand detail visually styled with teal accent dots. I placed it directly under the hero trust line and in the footer contact block, elevating it from body copy to a primary business asset.\n- **CTA Rhythm & Imagery Upgrades**: I removed the aggressive \"BOOK NOW\" buttons from every section. The page now leads with `Book a consultation`, transitions into subtle text links (`Talk to a Broker \342\206\222`, `Explore Home Loans \342\206\222`), and closes with the final solid CTA block. The hero imagery was also updated to feature warm, authentic, aspirational Australian suburban photography rather than generic business vectors."
    thinking: "**Confirming Completion**\n\nThe updates are complete, the final check reveals anchor IDs align in both `Navbar.tsx` and `page.tsx` for all relevant sections. Visual hierarchy is now refined, ensuring key sections like the Hero, Services, Brand Difference, and Final CTA stand out. Navigation is simplified to just `Services \302\267 About \302\267 Resources`.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completely rebuilt the layout architecture to establish a deliberate, premium visual hierarchy that honors your brand direction. The application is compiled and ready for preview.\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n- **Simplified Navigation Architecture**: The navigation is now reduced to the essential `Services \302\267 About \302\267 Resources` alongside a single, clear `Book a consultation` button. The anchor IDs (`#services`, `#about`, `#resources`) now properly map to the corresponding sections on the homepage.\n- **Masterful Visual Pacing**: I reorganized the homepage so that only four key sections (Hero, Services Entry, Brand Difference, and the Final Gradient CTA) feel like major editorial moments. The rest of the content (Lender Network, Calculator, Testimonials, FAQ) has been converted into visually quieter \"texture bands.\" This allows the site to breathe and prevents feature fatigue.\n- **Restrained Lender Strip**: The enormous abstract lender network was entirely removed. In its place, I introduced a quiet, grayscale credibility strip under the hero containing the 50+ lenders stat paired with subtle typography-based lender placeholders.\n- **Multilingual Brand Recognition**: The ability to serve clients in `English \302\267 \340\244\250\340\245\207\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\245\200 \302\267 \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200` is now a distinctive, recurring brand detail visually styled with teal accent dots. I placed it directly under the hero trust line and in the footer contact block, elevating it from body copy to a primary business asset.\n- **CTA Rhythm & Imagery Upgrades**: I removed the aggressive \"BOOK NOW\" buttons from every section. The page now leads with `Book a consultation`, transitions into subtle text links (`Talk to a Broker \342\206\222`, `Explore Home Loans \342\206\222`), and closes with the final solid CTA block. The hero imagery was also updated to